and JvmProtoBuf messages of its metadata.proto and jvm_metadata.proto, and its
metadata Flags), copyright JetBrains s.r.o. and Kotlin Programming Language
contributors, released under the Apache License, Version 2.0, which the plugin
ships shaded in plugins/kotlin/libs/metadata.jar together with the Protocol
Buffers lite runtime it runs on. kuna-jvm's decoder
(decompiler/nonnative/kuna-jvm/src/kotlin/kt_proto.rs and kt_flags.rs) is a
port of that schema and runtime. Protocol Buffers
