The JVM regression corpus (tests/jvm/) is derived from Vineflower's test data
and its plugins' test data (copyright JetBrains s.r.o. and the Vineflower
contributors, Apache License, Version 2.0): class files compiled or assembled
from their testData sources (the Kotlin ones with kotlinc 2.0.0 against
kotlin-stdlib, copyright JetBrains s.r.o. and Kotlin Programming Language
contributors, Apache License, Version 2.0, whose inline functions the compiler
copies into them), the class files they ship there, and the Java and Kotlin
text the released vineflower-1.12.0.jar prints for them; its provenance is
recorded in tests/jvm/README.md. The Kotlin fixture of the CLI tests
(tests/fixtures/jvm/kotlin/) is compiled the same way, from kuna's own sources.

